# Today lists its entries flat in document order, whatever their dates, each with its path.
file <<END
Work:
	Reports:
		- Quarterly @due({today-5})
- Water plants @start({today})
Home:
	- Rent @due({today-1})
END
keys gt
see Today
see ▌ - Quarterly  Work › Reports
see   - Water plants
see   - Rent  Home
